1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,235
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,235 --> 00:00:02,103
I'm Mimzi,

3
00:00:02,103 --> 00:00:03,506
and this is Teddy!

4
00:00:04,056 --> 00:00:05,185
Hi, hi!

5
00:00:05,735 --> 00:00:08,598
Let's learn ten first words.

6
00:00:08,848 --> 00:00:10,803
Ready? Let's go!

7
00:00:12,153 --> 00:00:14,058
This is a ball.

8
00:00:14,558 --> 00:00:16,897
Ball! Can you say ball?

9
00:00:19,197 --> 00:00:21,006
This is a book.

10
00:00:21,506 --> 00:00:23,643
Book! Can you say book?

11
00:00:25,943 --> 00:00:27,681
What is this?

12
00:00:29,481 --> 00:00:30,691
It's a cup!

13
00:00:30,691 --> 00:00:31,296
Cup!

14
00:00:31,846 --> 00:00:32,572
Cup!

15
00:00:33,922 --> 00:00:35,850
This is a car.

16
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:38,568
Car! Can you say car?

17
00:00:40,868 --> 00:00:42,773
This is a cat.

18
00:00:43,273 --> 00:00:45,510
Cat! Can you say cat?

19
00:00:47,810 --> 00:00:49,445
You're doing so well!

20
00:00:49,445 --> 00:00:50,875
Give Teddy a clap!

21
00:00:53,525 --> 00:00:55,263
What is this?

22
00:00:57,063 --> 00:00:58,434
It's a dog!

23
00:00:58,434 --> 00:00:59,119
Dog!

24
00:00:59,669 --> 00:01:00,577
Dog!

25
00:01:01,927 --> 00:01:03,903
This is a shoe.

26
00:01:04,403 --> 00:01:06,580
Shoe! Can you say shoe?

27
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:10,928
This is a spoon.

28
00:01:11,428 --> 00:01:13,928
Spoon! Can you say spoon?

29
00:01:16,228 --> 00:01:17,966
What is this?

30
00:01:19,766 --> 00:01:21,137
It's a bed!

31
00:01:21,137 --> 00:01:21,822
Bed!

32
00:01:22,372 --> 00:01:23,179
Bed!

33
00:01:24,529 --> 00:01:26,529
This is a teddy.

34
00:01:27,029 --> 00:01:29,468
Teddy! Can you say teddy?

35
00:01:31,768 --> 00:01:33,694
Let's say them all again,

36
00:01:33,694 --> 00:01:34,863
nice and fast!

37
00:01:35,413 --> 00:01:39,647
ball, book, cup, car, cat, dog, shoe, spoon, bed, teddy!

38
00:01:41,047 --> 00:01:43,991
Hooray! We learned so many words!

39
00:01:44,541 --> 00:01:46,779
Great job, little learner!

40
00:01:47,329 --> 00:01:49,217
Share Mimzi with a friend,

41
00:01:49,217 --> 00:01:51,757
and subscribe for more learning fun!

42
00:01:52,307 --> 00:01:53,187
Next time,

43
00:01:53,187 --> 00:01:56,501
let's meet some animals and hear their sounds.

44
00:01:56,751 --> 00:01:58,122
Bye bye!
